values ('ap_chemistry', 5, '5.8', array['5.8']::text[], 'convention', 'Rate law from a mechanism with rate-limiting first step', 'If every elementary step is irreversible, or the first step is rate limiting, the rate law is set by the molecularity of the slowest (rate-limiting) elementary step.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=task0067-chem-u5-u9-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_chemistry-u5-r1-025; ced=5.8.A.1 "set by the molecularity of the slowest elementary step (i.e., the rate-limiting step)"')
